hing that isn’t a problem in the first place. Can you please provide an option to suppress these warnings without having to annotate the relationship definitions themselves?\r\n\r\nit's true this is not the case this warning is intended for but some initial attempts to make it not emit for this case were unsuccessful so i dont have a fix right now. the \"overlaps\" parameter was added to allow for this case. i will try to tune warning but you can simply use the warnings filter<https://docs.python.org/3/library/warnings.html#warning-filter> to remove these warnings.\r\n\r\n—\r\nYou are receiving this because you authored the thread.\r\nReply to this email directly, view it on GitHub<https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6171#issuecomment-811241458>, or unsubscribe<https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AASPLIJLBVSG6BNKOOTJS7DTGNGVLANCNFSM42E5I3NA>.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/811250204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lauwers","id":2422177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjIxNzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2422177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers","html_url":"https://github.com/lauwers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lauwers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu